<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA BRM CALLS TENDER FOR USED ROLLING STOCK.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA BRM CALLS TENDER FOR USED ROLLING STOCK.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's Bucharest-based commodities exchange will call a tender to sell 980 used railway freight cars in May, the exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The minimum starting prices for the &quot;second hand functioning&quot; stock offered in the tender, scheduled for May 2, range from $2,050 to $6,900, according to the type, Bursa Romana de Marfuri (BRM) said in a statement.</p>
<p>Bidders have until April 30 to submit offers, it said.</p>
<p>The rolling stock on offer includes covered, flat and &quot;specialised&quot; cars, the BRM said.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom, 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
